00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.000
and feel refreshed,
your body temperature

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.568
actually has to increase
by one to three degrees.

00:05:55.568 --> 00:05:57.860
Therefore, controlling the
temperature of your sleeping

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.810
environment is absolutely key.

