02:02:31.040 --> 02:02:31.708
Pay them more.

02:02:31.708 --> 02:02:32.250
They need it.

02:02:32.250 --> 02:02:32.917
They deserve it.

02:02:32.917 --> 02:02:34.850
GINA POE: They deserve
